title: 'Asymptotic i.i.d. prophet inequalities: fixed-capacity limits and certified two-unit bounds'
type: article
authors:
  - name: Anonymous
version: 0.1.0-candidate
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23404235
license: CC0-1.0
abstract: >-
  Candidate research manuscript on the limiting worst-case i.i.d. prophet ratio
  for every fixed positive selection capacity, with a continuum minimax
  characterization and certified two-unit bounds 0.83695 to 0.8372914.
  Numerical witnesses concern two selections only. Original code is separately
  MIT licensed. This metadata does not assert human peer review or publication.
keywords:
  - prophet inequalities
  - online selection
  - continuum minimax
  - interval arithmetic
